msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"(Guess I'll try looking for the hitman Shu on the roof\r\n"
"of the Millennium Tower...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "(I should ask Ibuki's men to let me up to the roof.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"(The hitman Shu should be somewhere he can look out over\r\n"
"all of Kamurocho... Like the Millennium Tower?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"(On second thought, it might be way too high up for a\r\n"
"sniper. Still, there might be a good vantage point within\r\n"
"the building itself...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"(That street musician Hideki is always hanging around\r\n"
"the Millennium Tower. He might know something...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"(There's a street musician who's always hanging around in\r\n"
"front of the Millennium Tower. Maybe I should ask him some\r\n"
"questions.)"
msgstr ""

